<p>Creates a shield of impenetrable stone around you for 7 turns, absorbing up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">196, 233, 261, 284, 304</acronym> damage.</p><p>Your equilibrium will increase by twice the damage absorbed.</p><p>When the effect ends, all equilibrium above minimum will be converted to mana in a storm of arcane energy and the cooldown of your Block is reset.</p><p>The storm inflicts Arcane damage equal to the converted equilibrium (maximum <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">150, 267, 357, 433, 500</acronym>) against everyone around you in a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4.</acronym></p><p>Also while resting you will passively regenerate <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.25, 0.47, 0.66, 0.84, 1.00</acronym> mana each turn.</p><p>The shield strength will increase with Willpower</p>